@startuml
title D-03 Statutory Discount Review and Evidence Workflow

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor Operator
actor Supervisor
participant "Operator Console" as Console
participant "Central PMS /\nDiscount workflow" as Discount
participant "Evidence Store /\nReference" as Evidence
participant "Central PMS" as Central

Operator -> Console : open discount case
Console -> Discount : retrieve validation request/status
Discount --> Console : policy state, required evidence,\npayable-basis effect
Console -> Evidence : view/capture evidence where authorized
Evidence --> Console : evidence reference / hash
Operator -> Console : submit review / validation input
Console -> Discount : submit review through approved workflow
Discount -> Central : persist validation result\nand payable-basis effect
Supervisor -> Console : review override / escalation where allowed
Console -> Discount : supervisor decision through workflow

note over Console
Console is not the discount policy engine.
It does not mutate payable basis directly.
end note

@enduml
